          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner editorial-split"
              },
              "html": "<div><p class=\"section-label\">A night at home</p><h2 class=\"section-title\">Valentine’s Day at home, without a reservation</h2></div><div class=\"intent-prose\"><p>If a quiet evening sounds better than going out, stay in. You choose what to eat, when to sit down and how you want to spend the rest of the night.</p>\n<p>You do not need to cook for hours or redecorate the living room. A meal you like, somewhere comfortable and an activity you both want to try are enough. Here are five ideas to start with.</p></div>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "container",
          "tag": "section",
          "attrs": {
            "class": "ideas-section"
          },
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "container",
              "tag": "div",
              "attrs": {
                "class": "section-inner"
              },
              "blocks": [
                {
                  "type": "container",
                  "tag": "div",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-heading"
                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "p",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-label"
                      },
                      "html": "Made for sharing"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "h2",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "section-title"
                      },
                      "html": "Five ideas for your February 14 evening"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "element",
                  "tag": "ol",
                  "attrs": {
                    "class": "ideas-grid"
                  },
                  "html": "<li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">01 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 10h8v11H8zM12 10V8M12 8c5-1 2-5 0-7-2 2-5 6 0 7Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Order your favorite food</h3><p>If you do not feel like cooking, arrange takeout. Check opening times or order ahead if possible. Use plates, sit at the table and leave the washing up for later. For a toast, have a glass of champagne or an alcohol-free drink of your choice.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">02 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 18V5l12-2v13M9 9l12-2\"/><ellipse cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/><ellipse cx=\"18\" cy=\"16\" rx=\"3\" ry=\"3\"/></svg></div><h3>Put some music on</h3><p>Choose a playlist you both enjoy, lower the lights a little and silence notifications. You do not need entertainment planned: dinner can simply be a chance to catch up.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card \"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">03 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8A8.5 8.5 0 0 1 12.5 20a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8v.5Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Have dessert ready</h3><p>Pick something you both like: pastries, ice cream or a homemade dessert. Save it for later if you want; there is no next seating to make room for.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card featured\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">04 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 14v-3a9 9 0 0 1 18 0v3\"/><rect x=\"2\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/><rect x=\"17\" y=\"12\" width=\"5\" height=\"9\" rx=\"2\"/></svg></div><h3>Try audio together after dinner</h3><p>Install Caresse and play a free demo to see whether you enjoy the voice and format. If you want your own session, choose your preferences together. Generating it uses a paid credit.</p></li><li class=\"idea-card wide\"><div class=\"idea-top\"><span class=\"idea-number\">05 / 05</span><svg class=\"idea-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20.8 4.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 0L12 5.7l-1.1-1.1a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.8 7.8L12 21l8.8-8.6a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.8Z\"/></svg></div><h3>Offer a massage</h3><p>A back, shoulder or hand massage can be part of the evening if you both want one. Ask what feels good. You can leave it there or choose another activity.</p></li>"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
