                  },
                  "blocks": [
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What can we do for Valentine’s Day without going to a restaurant?</summary><p>Cook or order dinner, have dessert ready and choose something to do at home: an audio demo together, a massage or a chance to talk. Pick what appeals to both of you.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Can we keep the evening affordable?</summary><p>Yes. Choose a meal within your budget and start with a free Caresse demo. Generating a personalized session uses a paid credit, with no subscription.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>What can we do for Valentine’s Day at the last minute?</summary><p>Pick food that is easy to prepare or collect and one idea for afterwards. You do not need every detail planned to enjoy an evening at home.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>Do we have to do this on February 14?</summary><p>No. If you work late or have other commitments, choose another evening. These ideas work on a weekend before or after Valentine’s Day too.</p>"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "element",
                      "tag": "details",
                      "attrs": {
                        "class": "faq-item"
                      },
                      "html": "<summary>How can we celebrate Valentine’s Day with children and no babysitter?</summary><p>Plan a simple dinner for once the children are asleep and an activity to share somewhere private. Install Caresse and discover a demo beforehand, then decide together whether you would enjoy a paid personalized session.</p>"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
